#====================================================================
# OHOS 下 Conan test_package 可执行测试需 ELF 签名 + SDL dummy 无头执行
# SDL_kitchensink 1.0.13（CMake/C99，OHOS aarch64，Conan 2.29.1，clang 15）
#====================================================================

# ═══ Layer 0: 错误面 (Error Surface) ═══
id:                     DRAFT-sdl-kitchensink-1.0.13-ohos-elf-sign-sdl-headless-test
md_pair:                DRAFT-sdl-kitchensink-1.0.13-ohos-elf-sign-sdl-headless-test.md
trigger_tool: cmake|conan
phase: testing|packaging
error_signature: test_package .* Error in test\(\) method|self\.run.*失败|stub_test_method|SDL_.*Driver.*init|binary not found|codesign

# ═══ Layer 1: 识别层 (Recognition) ═══
severity: 3
category:               conan, cmake, testing, ohos, sdl2, elfsign
match_keywords: test_package, ELF signing, binary-sign-tool, selfSign, llvm-objcopy, codesign, SDL_VIDEODRIVER=dummy, SDL_AUDIODRIVER=dummy, stub_test_method, self.run, SDL_kitchensink, Kit_Init, Kit_GetVersion
title: Sign and headless-run Conan test_package executable tests on OHOS (SDL dummy drivers + self.run for L0d gate)

# ═══ Layer 2: 诊断层 (Diagnosis) ═══
root_cause: SDL_kitchensink 1.0.13 的 test_package 生成可执行测试 test_sdl_kitchensink（调用 Kit_GetVersion/Kit_GetSDLAudioFormatString/Kit_Init/Kit_Quit）。在 OHOS aarch64 + Conan 2 下：(1) OHOS 要求 ELF 代码签名（binary-sign-tool sign -selfSign 1）后才可加载执行，未签名则测试无法运行； (2) 测试调用 SDL 初始化，CI/无显示无声卡环境需显式 SDL_VIDEODRIVER=dummy / SDL_AUDIODRIVER=dummy 走 stub 后端； (3) CI L0d 门禁要求 test() 内含 self.run() 实际执行逻辑，否则判 stub_test_method 空壳拦截； (4) 测试若用 AUDIO_S16LSB 等 SDL 宏需显式 #include <SDL_audio.h>，且 sdl2 头在 include/SDL2/ 需由配方 cpp_info.includedirs 透传。
affected_scope: OHOS/arm64 上 test_package 产出可执行测试、且测试依赖 SDL（或同类需显示/音频初始化的库）的 Conan 配方；以及任何需 ELF 签名才能运行测试二进制的 OHOS 包。
verification_cmd: conan create archives/s/sdl-kitchensink/1.0.13 -pr:h=ci/conan/profiles/ohos-aarch64 -pr:b=ci/conan/profiles/ohos-aarch64 --user=ohpcd --channel=stable
verification_evidence: R06 conan create（含 test_package）G2 PASS；test 输出 'SDL_kitchensink version: 1.0.13' / 'SDL_PIXELFORMAT_RGB24 -> ...' / 'AUDIO_S16LSB -> AUDIO_S16' / 'test sdl-kitchensink 1.0.13: OK'，断言 4 项 1/1 PASS；日志含 'binary-sign-tool sign ... -selfSign 1' + 'add codesign section success'；W3 build_and_test.sh 隔离下 1/1。日志 reports/conan-create.log sha256=85d01a90d4ffea286a205b8857aa035c8116df677f9c20e841dc61e2f6235abf；reports/w3-r06-isolated.log sha256=ce386a37d16806141f213a55d7ba3306a5cc5ab6c35256e6566eab81891ff20c。

# ═══ Layer 3: 方案层 (Solution Space) ★ ═══
rec_priority: 1
rec_approach: sign-elf-and-sdl-dummy-headless-test
rec_description: test_package/conanfile.py 的 build() 内用 llvm-objcopy --remove-section .codesign（容忍失败）+ binary-sign-tool sign -selfSign 1 对测试 ELF 签名并移回、chmod 755；test() 内 os.environ 设 SDL_VIDEODRIVER=dummy / SDL_AUDIODRIVER=dummy，然后 self.run("'<bin>'", env="conanrun") 实际执行签名后二进制（真实调用库 API 做版本/格式字符串/初始化断言）；测试源显式 #include <SDL_audio.h>（用 AUDIO_S16LSB 等宏时），SDL include 路径由配方 cpp_info.includedirs 追加 sdl2 的 include/SDL2 透传（sdl2_image 先例）。
rec_command: |
  def build(self):
      cmake = CMake(self); cmake.configure(); cmake.build()
      self._sign_elf(os.path.join(self.cpp.build.bindirs[0], "test_sdl_kitchensink"))
  def _sign_elf(self, path):
      self.run('{oc} --remove-section .codesign "{f}" 2>/dev/null'.format(oc="/data/service/hnp/bin/llvm-objcopy", f=path), ignore_errors=True)
      tmp = path + ".signed"
      self.run('{sg} sign -inFile "{f}" -outFile "{t}" -selfSign 1'.format(sg="/data/service/hnp/bin/binary-sign-tool", f=path, t=tmp))
      if os.path.exists(tmp):
          shutil.move(tmp, path)
      os.chmod(path, 0o755)
  def test(self):
      os.environ["SDL_VIDEODRIVER"] = "dummy"
      os.environ["SDL_AUDIODRIVER"] = "dummy"
      self.run(f"'{os.path.join(self.cpp.build.bindirs[0], 'test_sdl_kitchensink')}'", env="conanrun")
rec_auto_fix: true
rec_impl: sign-elf-and-dummy-drivers
fallback_priority: 2
fallback_approach: none
fallback_description: 无（该子问题无替代方案：OHOS 必须签名；SDL 必须 dummy 无头；L0d 必须 self.run）
fallback_command: ""
fallback_auto_fix: false
fallback_impl: ""
forbid_1_pattern: 伪造.*测试|跳过.*签名.*当作.*通过|stub.*test.*当作.*PASS
forbid_1_reason: 不得以未签名的失败执行或空壳 test() 冒充测试通过；不得把本地验证当作远端发布
forbid_1_consequence: 数据失真导致门禁/路径判定错误
